{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2023-06-29 21:15:00', 'title': 'CBH ACQUIRES NARROW-GAUGE LOCOMOTIVES FROM WABTEC', 'text': "PERTH, AUSTRALIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE CBH GROUP (CBH) HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) TO ACQUIRE 17 NARROW-GAUGE LOCOMOTIVES, MARKING A SIGNIFICANT INVESTMENT IN EXPANDING THE CO-OPERATIVE'S RAIL FLEET AS PART OF THE ‘PATH TO 2033 STRATEGY'. WABTEC, A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF EQUIPMENT, SYSTEMS AND DIGITAL SOLUTIONS FOR THE FREIGHT AND TRANSIT RAIL SECTORS, WILL BUILD 17 CM20ACI DUAL-CAB, DIESEL-ELECTRIC LOCOMOTIVES FOR CBH. THE FIRST TRANCHE OF FIVE LOCOMOT."}